    "title": "Idle Slayer",
    "description": "Join the adventure of the idle hero in this idle rpg world.\r\n\r\nThe hero can earn coins even when you are not in the game.\r\nThere is a big great rpg world where you could explore.\r\nDo quest, pick up coins, upgrade swords and weapons to become the best knight or the best archer in the field.\r\n\r\nA lot of achievements and new places are ready to be discovered and only you can find what this game holds for you!",
